{%- comment -%}
  PG Cart Variants: make the console's storage picker in the cart look like a
  picker.

  pg-drawer already builds one. Its `vsel()` puts a <select> of every
  handheld-game-console variant on the cart line and, on change, zeroes the old
  variant and adds the new one at the same quantity, then refreshes the drawer.
  The control works -- it just does not read as a control: it is styled as a
  small bordered box with no chevron, 96px wide, sitting where a variant label
  would normally go, so it looks like a static "64G" chip and nobody thinks to
  click it.

  This gives it the affordance: a chevron, room for it, a slightly larger hit
  area and a pointer cursor. No behaviour is touched -- the swap is still
  pg-drawer's.

  The chevron is an inline data: URI so it needs no asset and cannot 404.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
#cart .l4ca .pg-vsel,
body.template-cart .form-cart .pg-vsel{
  -webkit-appearance:none !important;
  -moz-appearance:none !important;
  appearance:none !important;
  height:30px !important;
  max-width:132px !important;
  padding:2px 26px 2px 10px !important;
  font-size:13px !important;
  font-weight:700 !important;
  color:#4A1C66 !important;
  background-color:#fff !important;
  background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='11' height='7' viewBox='0 0 11 7'%3E%3Cpath d='M1 1l4.5 4.5L10 1' fill='none' stroke='%237A2FA2' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round'/%3E%3C/svg%3E") !important;
  background-repeat:no-repeat !important;
  background-position:right 9px center !important;
  border:1.5px solid rgba(122,47,162,.45) !important;
  border-radius:9px !important;
  cursor:pointer !important;
  box-shadow:0 2px 8px -4px rgba(74,28,102,.4) !important;
}
#cart .l4ca .pg-vsel:hover,
body.template-cart .form-cart .pg-vsel:hover{
  border-color:#7A2FA2 !important;
  background-color:#FBF7FE !important;
}
#cart .l4ca .pg-vsel:focus,
body.template-cart .form-cart .pg-vsel:focus{
  outline:none !important;
  border-color:#7A2FA2 !important;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(122,47,162,.18) !important;
}
#cart .l4ca .pg-vsel[disabled]{opacity:.55 !important;cursor:default !important}
</style>
{% schema %}
{"name": "PG Cart Variants", "settings": []}
{% endschema %}
